.TH MISSIONPLANNER10 1 "August 2026" "Mission Planner 10" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
missionplanner10 \- ground control station for ArduPilot vehicles
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B missionplanner10
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Mission Planner 10 is a native cross-platform Avalonia port of Mission Planner for flight
planning, telemetry, parameter management, log analysis, simulation, and vehicle
setup.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/MissionPlanner10
User configuration.
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/MissionPlanner10
Logs and persistent user data.
.TP
.I ~/.cache/MissionPlanner10
Downloaded terrain, SITL, parameter, and update caches. Map tiles intentionally remain in
.I ~/.cache/MissionPlanner/map-tiles
for compatibility with official Mission Planner and GTU.
.SH SEE ALSO
.UR https://github.com/Rouniy/MissionPlanner
Project home page
.UE
